    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9b8a684f-c39d-596e-9bd9-395ae2960955",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(157.5^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(157.5^\\circ\\right)=\n$$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(x\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^2\\left(157.5^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(157.5^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot 157.5^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(315^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(45^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3db5f214-cb95-5259-909b-dae04d21fe8c",
